        You need to extract all code statements that lead to the bug from the patch, based on the root cause and the commit message.

        Root cause:
        The `FilterIndexReader` class did not properly implement the `getSequentialSubReaders()` method, returning `null` instead of delegating the call to the underlying index reader, which resulted in incorrect behavior when attempting to access sub-readers.

        Commit message:
        LUCENE-2769: FilterIndexReader in trunk does not implement
 getSequentialSubReaders() correctly

